# Trivy risk acceptances for the user-service image
# =====================================================================
# Every entry needs: the reason it does not affect us, who accepted it,
# and an expiry date (exp:). After that date Trivy reports it again and
# the pipeline fails until someone fixes it or re-accepts it.
#
# Accepted 2026-10-22 (instructor review)
# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (needs Spring
# Boot 4 - planned migration). Not exploitable here: user-service is a
# JSON REST API and uses neither XsltView nor Server-Sent Events / view
# fragments (checked: no XsltView, SseEmitter or text/event-stream in src).
# =====================================================================

# Remote code execution via improper path limitation in XsltView
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

